pt most of his infantry near the center as the army reserve; elements crossed the Potomac during the September 19–20 pursuit"}]]}],["$","div","Ninth Corps and Army of the Potomac left wing-Maj. Gen. Ambrose E. Burnside",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Ninth Corps and Army of the Potomac left wing"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Maj. Gen. Ambrose E. Burnside"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Requested reinforcements while the corps held its bridgehead west of Antietam Creek"}]]}],["$","div","Immediate command of the Ninth Corps-Brig. Gen. Jacob D. Cox",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Immediate command of the Ninth Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Brig. Gen. Jacob D. Cox"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Ordered the advance near Sharpsburg withdrawn and formed a defensive line above the Lower Bridge"}]]}],["$","div","3rd Division, Ninth Corps-Brig. Gen. Isaac P. Rodman",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"3rd Division, Ninth Corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Brig. Gen. Isaac P. Rodman"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Tried to change front against Hill’s arrival and was mortally wounded while riding toward the threatened flank"}]]}],["$","div","2nd Brigade, Rodman’s division-Col. Edward Harland",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"2nd Brigade, Rodman’s division"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Col. Edward Harland"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Commanded the 8th and 16th Connecticut and 4th Rhode Island; attempted to restore the separated brigade after his horse was shot"}]]}],["$","div","Kanawha Division-Col. Eliakim P. Scammon",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Kanawha Division"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Col. Eliakim P. Scammon"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Used the 12th, 23rd, and 30th Ohio to change front and oppose Hill’s counterattack before withdrawing into Cox’s final line"}]]}],"$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"]]}],"$L2f"]}],"$L30"]]]}]
